'''Warrior [[Vabbian armor]]''' is [[prestige armor|prestige]] art type available in the Nightfall campaign. Vabbian armor is considered prestige since it is very expensive due to the high amount of [[ruby|rubies]] and [[Sapphire|sapphires]] needed to craft it.

There is no standard version of Vabbian armor. 

